  "ruleText": "Ins 6101.01 Scope and Applicability. This chapter is applicable to all ancillary health insurance policies and certificates issued or provided by a carrier on a group basis.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Ins 6100) #12471, eff 1-31-18",
